### MODEL (turn 2)
The bug is in `money()` in `shop/fmt.py`, which uses `f"${x:.2f}"` with no thousands separator. I'll change the format spec to `,.2f`, which keeps the same two decimals and adds commas, then rerun the tests.
[tool call luau]
print(edit("shop/fmt.py", 'return f"${x:.2f}"', 'return f"${x:,.2f}"'))
print(sh("python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -t . 2>&1 | tail -5").stdout)
