### MODEL (turn 3)
Receipt amounts now get thousands separators: `money()` in `shop/fmt.py` uses `:,.2f` instead of `:.2f`, so `1234.5` formats as `$1,234.50`. The full test suite passes (4 tests, including the previously failing `test_order_and_money`).
